{"id":"drv-ext-haptic","type":"text","x":5292,"y":1876,"width":400,"height":272,"text":"**Haptic driver (ext_haptic)**\nPlays PWM vibration patterns and strength…\n\nruns: haptic esp_timer chain, per pattern segment.\n\n`WORKING`\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"task-ui","type":"text","x":4380,"y":2616,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**main / app_main UI loop**\nBoot, power-state machine, serial command…\n\nruns: core 0, prio 1, 8192 B. ON about 60 Hz (40 Hz authored); AOD/SENSOR 1 Hz frames; OFF 50 Hz loop, no frames.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|3 gaps]]\n[[Engine and scheduling|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"task-board-fs","type":"text","x":4836,"y":2616,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**board-fs task**\nDevice retry, SD mount retry, pedometer NVS…\n\nruns: prio 1, 4 KB. 100 ms loop, always on.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|1 gap]]\n[[Storage and persistence|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"#808890"},
{"id":"task-board-sense","type":"text","x":5292,"y":2616,"width":400,"height":296,"text":"**board-sense task**\nIMU loop (3 reads per cycle, about 150/s)…\n\nruns: prio 2, 4 KB static, no affinity. 20 ms cycle, always on, screen off included.\n\n`WORKING` · ⚠ [[Gaps|6 gaps]]\n[[Hardware and drivers|Open note]]\n↗ GHOST · one-hop neighbour","color":"1"},
